{"1":{"w":[{"c":"أَلَمْ","d":"alam","e":"Have not"},{"c":"تَرَ","d":"tara","e":"you seen"},{"c":"كَيْفَ","d":"kayfa","e":"how"},{"c":"فَعَلَ","d":"faʿala","e":"dealt"},{"c":"رَبُّكَ","d":"rabbuka","e":"your Lord"},{"c":"بِأَصْحَابِ","d":"bi-aṣḥābi","e":"with (the) Companions"},{"c":"الْفِيلِ","d":"l-fīli","e":"(of the) Elephant"}],"a":{"g":"Have you not considered, [O Muhammad], how your Lord dealt with the companions of the elephant?"}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"أَلَمْ","d":"alam","e":"Did not"},{"c":"يَجْعَلْ","d":"yajʿal","e":"He make"},{"c":"كَيْدَهُمْ","d":"kaydahum","e":"their plan"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"go"},{"c":"تَضْلِيلٍ","d":"taḍlīlin","e":"astray"}],"a":{"g":"Did He not make their plan into misguidance?"}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَرْسَلَ","d":"wa-arsala","e":"And He sent"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِمْ","d":"ʿalayhim","e":"against them"},{"c":"طَيْرًا","d":"ṭayran","e":"birds"},{"c":"أَبَابِيلَ","d":"abābīla","e":"(in) flocks"}],"a":{"g":"And He sent against them birds in flocks,"}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"تَرْمِيهِمْ","d":"tarmīhim","e":"Striking them"},{"c":"بِحِجَارَةٍ","d":"biḥijāratin","e":"with stones"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"سِجِّيلٍ","d":"sijjīlin","e":"baked clay"}],"a":{"g":"Striking them with stones of hard clay,"}},"5":{"w":[{"c":"فَجَعَلَهُمْ","d":"fajaʿalahum","e":"Then He made them"},{"c":"كَعَصْفٍ","d":"kaʿaṣfin","e":"like straw"},{"c":"مَأْكُولٍ","d":"makūlin","e":"eaten up"}],"a":{"g":"And He made them like eaten straw."}}}